{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27279","headline":"玄都观栽桃十韵 · 章孝标","name":"玄都观栽桃十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"驱使鬼神功，攒栽万树红。\n薰香丹凤阙，妆点紫琼宫。\n宝帐重遮日，妖金遍累空。\n色然烧药火，影舞步虚风。\n粉扑青牛过，枝惊白鹤冲。\n拜星春锦上，服食晚霞中。\n棋局阴长合，箫声秘不通。\n艳阳迷俗客，幽邃失壶公。\n根柢终盘石，桑麻自转蓬。\n求师饱灵药，他日访辽东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章孝标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27279.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27279","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}